  "head": {
    "text": "WF-018 — PCLK_MODE updates only after capture stops and both FIFOs are empty"
  },
  "foot": {
    "text": "The first mode write is acknowledged but masked while capture is active. After capture is disabled, the source stop reaches APB and the FIFO drains, the retry updates PCLK_MODE. APB writes to DVP_CTRL remain full-word accesses."
  },
